  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Card dividers were printed on a Chandler and Price letterpress in 12pt Typewriter. Pamphlet text was typed on a Royal Custom IV typewriter and digitally printed. Images were screenprinted onto French Paper (made in America) and the box insert was covered in Texlifil bookcloth (made in France)"--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
